      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2d18db3e5e4b3102c24c54|full_name}: if rec room had more mature people in there, sure 😂 but yah there’s a substantially stronger mature base plus lots of language exchange going on here more so. I suppose my other consideration is since there’s already unofficial ways to do it, which I never tried, then might as well hog the market with a real mobile app as well.",
