  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-01-03T05:54:18.768Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to see a mobile version probably optimized for tablets like iPads etc for vrchat. If performance is an issue then it can simply have the same compatibility as the quest. This would also be helpful for those building cross platform content but for example, they use a pc or pc vr only but with the tablet option they can can also test out how the world looks like for the mobile mode. \nThere’s clearly sites that made backhanded ways to get vrchat on the phone (such as ipzilla or appyeet) so it is highly possible to have an app officially supported by vrchat on the official android and iOS stores.",
